  "task_html": "<div class='task-block task-green'><div class='task-block-label'>Steigung aus zwei Punkten berechnen</div><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 12px;'>Wenn zwei Punkte einer Geraden bekannt sind, l&auml;sst sich die Steigung direkt ausrechnen &ndash; ohne Graph.</p><div style='background:#1C1B1F;color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:2;margin-bottom:12px;'><strong>Vorgehen:</strong><br>&#x2460;&nbsp;y-Differenz: &Delta;y = y&#x2082; &minus; y&#x2081;<br>&#x2461;&nbsp;x-Differenz: &Delta;x = x&#x2082; &minus; x&#x2081;<br>&#x2462;&nbsp;Steigung: m = &Delta;y : &Delta;x</div><div style='background:#f0fdf4;border:1.5px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;font-size:13px;'><strong>Beispiel:</strong>&nbsp;P&#x2081;(1|2) und P&#x2082;(3|6)<br><span style='font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;'>&Delta;y = 6 &minus; 2 = 4 &nbsp;|&nbsp; &Delta;x = 3 &minus; 1 = 2 &nbsp;|&nbsp; m = 4 : 2 = <strong>2</strong></span></div><div style='display:flex;justify-content:center;margin:10px 0 4px;'><svg viewBox='0 0 160 155' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' style='width:100%;max-width:220px;display:block;'><defs><marker id='ah4' markerWidth='8' markerHeight='6' refX='6' refY='3' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L0,6 L8,3 z' fill='#555'/></marker></defs><line x1='36' y1='14' x2='36' y2='135' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='56' y1='14' x2='56' y2='135' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='76' y1='14' x2='76' y2='135' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='96' y1='14' x2='96' y2='135' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='16' y1='15' x2='104' y2='15' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='16' y1='55' x2='104' y2='55' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='16' y1='95' x2='104' y2='95' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='16' y1='115' x2='104' y2='115' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.8'/><line x1='10' y1='135' x2='112' y2='135' stroke='#555' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#ah4)'/><line x1='16' y1='143' x2='16' y2='5' stroke='#555' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#ah4)'/><text x='36' y='148' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#888'>1</text><text x='56' y='148' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#888'>2</text><text x='76' y='148' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#888'>3</text><text x='96' y='148' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9' fill='#888'>4</text><text x='12' y='98' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#888'>2</text><text x='12' y='58' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#888'>4</text><text x='12' y='18' text-anchor='end' font-size='9' fill='#888'>6</text><text x='116' y='139' font-size='9' fill='#555'>x</text><text x='19' y='3' font-size='9' fill='#555'>y</text><line x1='16' y1='135' x2='79' y2='8' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'/><line x1='36' y1='95' x2='76' y2='95' stroke='#d97706' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-dasharray='5,3'/><line x1='76' y1='95' x2='76' y2='15' stroke='#6d28d9' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-dasharray='5,3'/><circle cx='36' cy='95' r='4' fill='#2563eb' stroke='white' stroke-width='1.5'/><circle cx='76' cy='15' r='4' fill='#2563eb' stroke='white' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='20' y='110' font-size='9' fill='#1d4ed8' font-weight='bold'>P&#x2081;(1|2)</text><text x='79' y='28' font-size='9' fill='#1d4ed8' font-weight='bold'>P&#x2082;(3|6)</text><text x='56' y='108' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10' fill='#15803d' font-weight='bold'>&Delta;x = 2</text><text x='81' y='58' font-size='10' fill='#6d28d9' font-weight='bold'>&Delta;y = 4</text></svg></div></div><div class='task-block task-green'><div class='task-block-label'>Aufgaben &ndash; Berechne m</div><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin:10px 0;'><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;'>a)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>P&#x2081;(0|1) und P&#x2082;(3|7)</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>m&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='2' placeholder='?' style='width:72px;text-align:center;'></label></div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;'>b)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>P&#x2081;(1|4) und P&#x2082;(3|2)</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>m&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='-1' placeholder='?' style='width:72px;text-align:center;'></label></div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;'>c)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>P&#x2081;(&minus;2|3) und P&#x2082;(2|5)</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>m&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='0.5' placeholder='?' style='width:72px;text-align:center;'></label></div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;'>d)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>P&#x2081;(0|&minus;1) und P&#x2082;(2|5)</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>m&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='3' placeholder='?' style='width:72px;text-align:center;'></label></div></div><div class='check-bar'><button class='btn-check' onclick='checkStation(4)'>&#x2713; &Uuml;berpr&uuml;fen</button><button class='btn-reset' onclick='resetStation(4)'>&#x21BA; Zur&uuml;cksetzen</button><span class='check-result' id='check-result-4'></span></div></div>",
  "sol_html": "<div style='font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;'><p style='font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;color:#16a34a;'>Vorgehen: &Delta;y = y&#x2082;&minus;y&#x2081; &nbsp;|&nbsp; &Delta;x = x&#x2082;&minus;x&#x2081; &nbsp;|&nbsp; m = &Delta;y : &Delta;x</p><div style='font-family:monospace;line-height:2.2;'>a) &Delta;y = 7&minus;1 = 6 &nbsp;&nbsp; &Delta;x = 3&minus;0 = 3 &nbsp;&nbsp; &rarr; m = 6:3 = <strong>2</strong><br>b) &Delta;y = 2&minus;4 = &minus;2 &nbsp;&nbsp; &Delta;x = 3&minus;1 = 2 &nbsp;&nbsp; &rarr; m = &minus;2:2 = <strong>&minus;1</strong><br>c) &Delta;y = 5&minus;3 = 2 &nbsp;&nbsp; &Delta;x = 2&minus;(&minus;2) = 4 &nbsp;&nbsp; &rarr; m = 2:4 = <strong>0,5</strong><br>d) &Delta;y = 5&minus;(&minus;1) = 6 &nbsp;&nbsp; &Delta;x = 2&minus;0 = 2 &nbsp;&nbsp; &rarr; m = 6:2 = <strong>3</strong></div></div>"
